---
---
<section class="section-alt" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Natgenic</p>
      <h2 class="h-lg">Designed around one focus.</h2>
      <div class="divider" style="margin-top:28px"></div>
      <p class="lead">
        Every part of Natgenic is built around hair fall, thinning and long-term
        hair-care consistency.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 21V11" /><path d="M12 11c0-4 3-7 7-7 0 4-3 7-7 7z" />
            <path d="M12 14c0-3-2.5-5.5-5.5-5.5C6.5 11.5 9 14 12 14z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Supports Hair Growth</h3>
        <p>Helps support healthier-looking hair and new growth as part of a consistent routine.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 20a8 8 0 1 0-8-8" /><path d="M4 12 2 10" /><path d="M4 12l2-2" />
            <path d="M12 8v4l3 2" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Helps Reduce Hair Fall</h3>
        <p>Designed for people dealing with persistent hair shedding.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M5 19V9" /><path d="M9.5 19V5" /><path d="M14 19v-9" /><path d="M18.5 19V7" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Supports Thinning Hair</h3>
        <p>Created with hair density and overall scalp hair health in mind.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" /><path d="M12 7.5V12l3.2 2" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Made for Long-Term Care</h3>
        <p>Designed to be used consistently rather than as a one-time treatment.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
